WEBVTT

00:07:27.361 --> 00:07:30.710
In my three years in this world,
I got a few nasty phone calls,

00:07:30.734 --> 00:07:32.254
even some threats,

00:07:32.278 --> 00:07:35.708
but it wasn't a fraction of what
female journalists get on this beat.

00:07:36.791 --> 00:07:38.182
And yeah, I am Jewish,

00:07:38.206 --> 00:07:41.855
although, weirdly, a lot of the Nazis
couldn't tell I was Jewish,

00:07:41.879 --> 00:07:44.740
which I frankly just found
kind of disappointing.

00:07:44.764 --> 00:07:46.564
(Laughter)

00:07:46.588 --> 00:07:50.554
Seriously, like, your whole job
is being a professional anti-Semite.

00:07:51.228 --> 00:07:53.650
Nothing about me
is tipping you off at all?

00:07:53.674 --> 00:07:54.750
Nothing?

00:07:54.774 --> 00:07:57.077
(Laughter)

00:07:57.983 --> 00:07:59.178
This is not a secret.

00:07:59.202 --> 00:08:01.885
My name is Andrew Marantz,
I write for "The New Yorker,"